WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.944
Classification should lead to an analytical decision
Once you understand

00:00:05.957 --> 00:00:11.536
the variable choose summaries that respect the scale
visualizations that show the intended comparison

00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:17.761
and encodings that do not introduce false structure
Then validate the transformed

00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:24.369
result This is not a rigid cookbook Distribution

00:00:24.514 --> 00:00:30.172
study design and analytical goals still matter but
measurement meaning gives us a defensible starting

00:00:30.185 --> 00:00:30.567
point
